club-QuickBox icon library
===========================

The glyph path data in `library.json` is a curated subset of Material Design
Icons (MDI), redistributed under the Apache License 2.0.

  Project: Material Design Icons (Templarian/MaterialDesign)
  Source:  https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign
  License: Apache-2.0
           https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign/blob/master/LICENSE

Each entry stores the MDI glyph body (a 24x24 viewBox path) together with a
QuickBox name, a category, and search tags. The icons are tinted at render
time with the active theme token, so no original colour is retained.

No third-party brand or application logos (for example the *arr media tools)
are included; those names resolve to their neutral category glyph instead.

